<title>UK: British Gas says TransCo unit head resigns.</title>
<headline>British Gas says TransCo unit head resigns.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Gas Plc said on Tuesday that Harry Moulson had resigned from the board and relinquished his post as managing director of its TransCo pipeline unit due to medical reasons.</p>
</text>
